Copyright 2021 The Android Open Source Project
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0: http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

tv/app/src/main/java/androidx/media3/exoplayer/rtsp/ is a copy of media3-exoplayer-rtsp 1.4.1
(https://github.com/androidx/media). The copy keeps the Apache 2.0 header in every file.
It has two changes, marked "Hermes TV patch" in the source:
1. RtspMediaTrack.java: H.265 parameter sets sent in the H.264-style sprop-parameter-sets
   attribute are ordered as [VPS,] SPS, PPS, so the stream can play.
2. reader/RtpH265Reader.java: the NAL unit type of a fragmented unit comes from the first
   fragment only, because some cameras fill later fragment headers differently.

Scenery photos
